00:12:55.275 --> 00:12:59.241
not a bunch of hours in front of GMT.

00:12:59.241 --> 00:13:02.770
In short, all of these
islands are on Monday side.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:07.770
PacIOOS has it right, and
Google Maps has it wrong.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:08.893
Wait, what?

00:13:08.893 --> 00:13:10.430
Google Maps has something wrong.

